/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cheongfish/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cheongfish/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cheongfish/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "2d12b4ae228f6f232b0cb97532e5d0a8a0ca288f", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/cheongfish/Airflow-On-Kind/commits/2d12b4ae228f6f232b0cb97532e5d0a8a0ca288f", "html_url": "https://github.com/cheongfish/Airflow-On-Kind/commit/2d12b4ae228f6f232b0cb97532e5d0a8a0ca288f"}]}, {"sha": "2d12b4ae228f6f232b0cb97532e5d0a8a0ca288f", "node_id": "C_kwDOK64sMdoAKDJkMTJiNGFlMjI4ZjZmMjMyYjBjYjk3NTMyZTVkMGE4YTBjYTI4OGY", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Cheongwoon", "email": "rla10324@naver.com", "date": "2025-07-15T05:56:42Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Cheongwoon", "email": "rla10324@naver.com", "date": "2025-07-15T05:56:42Z"}, "message": "feat: Upgrade Airflow Helm Chart to 1.18.0 and Airflow to 3.0.2\n\nThis commit introduces a major upgrade to the Airflow Helm Chart, bringing it to version 1.18.0 and updating the default Airflow version to 3.0.2.\n\nKey changes include:\n- **Airflow 3.0.2 Integration:** Full support for Airflow 3.0.2, including new API server components and related configurations.\n- **New API Server:** Introduction of dedicated API server deployments, services, ingresses, and network policies.\n- **Documentation Overhaul:** Extensive updates and additions to the Helm chart documentation, covering new features and configurations.\n- **Dependency Updates:** Upgraded versions of PgBouncer, PgBouncer Exporter, StatsD, and GitSync images for improved stability and features.\n- **Chart Enhancements:** Various improvements across templates and values to support the new Airflow version and enhance chart functionality.", "tree": {"sha": "1434c65e3f0f3ebd2e7a5380f81899717b1cfea7", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/cheongfish/Airflow-On-Kind/git/trees/1434c65e3f0f3ebd